index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..b32e1e87fdae5e4a3b0a28526906e172dc418508
--- /dev/null
+++ b/KIO-FORK.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# KIO PDF
+
+Independent KIO branding fork of [PdfCraft v0.8.0](https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft/tree/9931329b9fae0b05373b4dc3ac7c58541f0891a4), originally by the ArtCraft team and contributors. KIO branding is not endorsed by ArtCraft.
+
+Original engine, codecs, formats and features are retained. Original LICENSE, NOTICE, contributor credits and asset attribution remain applicable and are preserved. KIO icon is the existing user-supplied KIO artwork; no ArtCraft trademark logo is included.
+
+Inherited limitations: Existing-text edits, non-Latin OCR, Office conversion, signatures, print fidelity and professional PDF workflows remain incomplete.
+
+This patch has not been compiled or functionally verified. Do not describe it as a completed native release until the platform build, profile separation and file round-trip checks pass.
